Burden
<---------------------------------------------------------------------->
Burden M points for D seconds

Base Cost: 1.0

Burden will increase the target's current Encumbrance by M points for D seconds. If you break through the target's maximum Encumbrance, they will be rendered immobile for the duration of the effect.

Note that Burden can be resisted with Resist Magicka and, alternatively, can be amplified by Weakness to Magicka. Largely the same effect can be achieved by using Drain Strength, which may be a more helpful option because it will also lower a target's maximum
Fatigue and weapon damage.

