Open
<---------------------------------------------------------------------->
Open M points

Base Cost: 6.0

Opens a locked door or container. The magnitude is the level of the lock that the spell can successfully open. Note that, much like the distinction between lockpicks and probes, this effect does nothing
about traps.

Casting any Open spell as a touch or target effect will qualify as a crime if witnessed, just like using a lockpick.

